#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2a3e1f725742fa9b67345539689830b9b43d1c9b2c2e47dab59d5337b9de77f
#. default-sha256: dbd9304722c4cb4591d6bf6a5c6ba6668183c95ada5faea3e694c8fe56d6e283
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫不断书写的信，⟪k:8⟫不仅没让事态得到好转，⟪k:9⟫反而增加了两"
"人之间的误解……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfbc837de4e81d0112399c9d31b74c8d213b2867b7ddb0b86fdd4ee8a0398680
#. default-sha256: c0909fb95e5302ce24016c128cc506c69bb2bac683e385a4edd9d17e469feef5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这样的日子，⟪k:1⟫持续了数个月。⟪k:2⟫终于，⟪k:3⟫阳光明媚舒适的春天到来了，⟪k:4⟫但两人的关系却"
"仍处于极寒之中。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d981a7627b86adfd7a88d0eb28c4755fc0c68b4882f5ec5271756c3d24ea4871
#. default-sha256: c251f66683bc7a660a26679ee834d91e54062574c2f91d4780a7d41ce2caaf03
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫无法出门——即使写信也没有回应。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫她能接触到的现实，⟪k:3⟫只有玛利亚的话而已。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5ace37e6efa73e1af2dc33f6734b5ab919470e75f0848b2276c87ee832b4547
#. default-sha256: da78f637aa880d357242d9146147489697aaf3d58be812d13885ec13c844f35f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在这样重复着的日子里，⟪k:1⟫也产生了特殊变化。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df5ca4a63b23904b6bc157f21e0f76884df3f4d25079be9a13927e7af9b471cb
#. default-sha256: feb526c71d9a7b6adb55dfad35a952e260aec217e6230662fa4e33902071c7ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没错——⟪k:1⟫发生变化的是少女的内心。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c281a7c92197a09382b7b36b24a365e790f6d8ace8a1dce3253b93133d677b67
#. default-sha256: 85417d1e4c1859eb08ff27f9227ee908dae49faadff88e5b6096a5daa8c1db51
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫夫人——⟪k:9⟫已经没戏了啊。⟪k:10⟫就算再怎么写，⟪k:11⟫也"
"没有意义的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7339b6d045add6fe36becd722861829740de9ef637c949bc7969b7eb3935489
#. default-sha256: 24580124b06b64c2028a33e8d43f4d01ea8917771c101dcdc443e93621bef45f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我看到了。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫那家伙——把夫人写的信，⟪k:5⟫扔进了暖炉里面……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7172f2b64f3d4c602b384aa12861c1874cfcf3fb26e8bb19ae7d64401d93dd7e
#. default-sha256: d9e48b688b7ab515d2a6dfc4f150bce0c322f4928abef1ad431e197fd6508cd8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他已经连看都不肯看一眼了。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫明明是夫人倾注全部心意写的信。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 654380151d842cb66a6b3b30d8adcee410b65327039d7ccdd60cdd4ce73ccbe8
#. default-sha256: 0a5f0d51ac2863e64afc484cf377c998ecd76f841078c77f01a3bc0d5d69176e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那家伙比起对人的感情，⟪k:1⟫更喜欢金钱和事业。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他就是那种男人啊。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1813bfab6dcc8c59f7b1178c4678d17c5e93400936b1bfc81f2a6490a294b6b0
#. default-sha256: 824c38ff6ebc233ab694c2619939ae1a0080fbfcdae7f633401070caea4fd8dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Just give up and file for divorce already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫赶快放弃，⟪k:1⟫跟他提出离婚不就好了吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 887740bf8175debbc635d3403a1c1b81e462cd64c1e58ae5b77abad0eba5e70d
#. default-sha256: e4de6cb8d83745a63d0a08ad7c42deb67e6b6e6d24c6a5b755aa9aede80a148f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫................................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………………………………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dacb9867b80d4d6e998c8a59d48fecb96c04e2dd05dc6d8eb1ed83ce0c18ae1e
#. default-sha256: aab1075d53b130c14c154ee83594f083abb32a095a2f7a4fec7eda4179789b32
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫No..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……不……⟪k:2⟫不……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbc6deece541928e3e2622d666eb66b17e77941f4657c7f07138e32ac11d52a2
#. default-sha256: fdfd7f269934184ac25062559af28ce1c789ac18d7f2c0e16c30ed2c61910512
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I will get through to him...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everything will go back to normal...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
"faith."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫总有一天……会传达到……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫所有的一切，⟪k:3⟫都会回到从前……我是这么、⟪k:4⟫相信着的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae0f2129a218a6e88de72f4b17fe05a6a269cb43071899b2518f5a70178eab72
#. default-sha256: 0b39d3748f36e94ad08a517f53fcb82b0b734f1e613838b5e8e124d8bd0a5ca2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All my letters may go up in flames...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but my faith will not be lost with them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使信件被烧成灰……⟪k:1⟫我对他的信任，⟪k:2⟫也不会消失的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faf124d682b9a733881766eee495a871cf1915e58043eca8d761fe57f99d616f
#. default-sha256: 2ad237b4c673fe2cc5acc4ec17475219d165b4b9e0a8a4f74027a3093fd9c1d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As long as I keep writing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫继续写下去的话，⟪k:1⟫一定……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 347cb331d2e30282716cb027ba7c3250627c38aaf579d53a12dbf5db1dd4cd19
#. default-sha256: d64f521f102f27720ef698fd83d102b179bbef1935715912bdad847afdb5b94d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫eventually... ⟪k:1⟫I will get through to him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I cannot stop... ⟪k:4⟫I cannot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫会传达到的……一定会的。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫所以，⟪k:3⟫我不会放弃的……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20f2cf41c6ef01eb9a96936ee69ca2d5b5b5be234018fa7e4bce1db3713bc030
#. default-sha256: 77f3f68c29a71b9996aef76fed6d825c0887589ce5af73e6cc54d3900a69b67a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have any idea what he says about you, Madam?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……那家伙，⟪k:2⟫是怎么说夫人您的……您知道吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 703fc49d9316bcce792fb08436bb69bc258259560a74b578df23491f506a4449
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 824f1e17e95fac235b554c79ba4e4dea2aeea2c4fa985227c75d73ad2e6170fa
#. default-sha256: 25b022b8428c7f7a6d91c69921e3557420ffae59743adca897fc756913460897
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo doesn’t trust you in the ⟪k:2⟫slightest⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He goes around calling "
"you a witch.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫A man-eating devil-woman."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫他的疑心病很重的啊。⟪k:2⟫他把夫人您称作魔女。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫说您是欺骗男人的恶魔……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a1f2820d226a62a5e935302c7ceb688e7b8200bb8741d0a8bc2bd0787b8d6b8
#. default-sha256: 7804bf0294af50a7c4bb4c60a9834915428a5cbddca9f0b37bb7729e5704cf0d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s awful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s no one as pure and as beautiful as you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫太过分了。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫明明没有人比夫人更美丽、⟪k:4⟫更纯洁。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47dda32d9bd9be9b9c8aa4bca24627598b78299c9b8019f9e2f0d3788b121015
#. default-sha256: e77cb188fb5ebcd195bed5e981ec6c6790ede751ca28a87832d8c4a74ffb02ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He says... ⟪k:2⟫I am a witch?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫把我称作……魔女……⟪k:2⟫吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6558a78ddb30cea290795c1b7e7a6b2373c5fa4d724ab8c286e80b5ec1b83dc7
#. default-sha256: b8e71c3e63d4ec6f356a7b11842d660018358ab0fc4dd0c3dbb5883f73ce90fd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Listen to me, Madam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He never for a second ⟪k:4⟫actually⟪k:5⟫ loved you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夫人——⟪k:2⟫那家伙从最开始，⟪k:3⟫就没有爱过您啊。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae5512290c04dff1cd251dda9951a920ef9b188be8216da8d75dff01ea1f8d23
#. default-sha256: bbc031914ea59faa3ff40e6e85ba0db34592c9be121397c14c0dca692afd68f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He just wanted the influence attached to your name.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wanted to mingle with the upper "
"class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫只是想要得到名门贵族的权力——仅此而已。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只是想要得到进入社交界的入场券，⟪k:3⟫仅此而"
"已。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3467368f6f1edc9c79a5f1e78afbc543dcc79affc52deccf868b089a148d6be
#. default-sha256: dfc162eb84326b37faa01f7b7bd29a0feb1cbdacfc147fae146413af76c86bbd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He ⟪k:1⟫used⟪k:2⟫ you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他是在利用夫人啊。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FE46BE7_958C_4C8C_B141_10A50D9C9847
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4a68d99f3725058b95560c66c9d6853199f5f93770793706b29ee4309cdf5fa
#. default-sha256: 2000e3a554146f39c860e08703ef985777d62e6df0cd91d30ce31ce3bf1d3b2e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FE46BE7_958C_4C8C_B141_10A50D9C9847"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But last year... ⟪k:2⟫when we went out together..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……但是……⟪k:2⟫一年前，⟪k:3⟫一起出门的时候……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFE7A7E_D651_4FF5_B9AC_78B8BC3B1DFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
